  mt=102  Capture                                                 9437 1451  201
     The cross section in the energy range below 1 MeV was derived9437 1451  202
     as a product of the evaluated fission cross section and alpha9437 1451  203
     value. The alpha values are identical to those of JENDL-2.   9437 1451  204
     Above 1 MeV the results of the statistical model calculation 9437 1451  205
     with casthy /21/ linked with ecis /19/ were adopted. The     9437 1451  206
     photon strength function was normalized in the casthy        9437 1451  207
     calculation so as to reproduce the capture cross section of  9437 1451  208
     280 mb at 100 keV.                                           9437 1451  209
     Direct and semi-direct calculations were performed by Kawano 9437 1451  210
     /37/ above 500 keV.                                          9437 1451  211
